A partially prefixed quoted run continuation keeps its source column

```
> > {.x
>    .y}
plain
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>

  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>plain</p>
```

```
> >  {.x
>     .y}
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>

  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
- > {.x
  >  .y}
plain
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>

    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>plain</p>
```
